Hello hello hello, and thank you for playing Sigh of the Abyss ːsotaloveː
Today's small patch includes some bugfixes and a quality of life improvement!
Bugfixes

 Fixed the 'black screen at launch' issue. This was caused by double clicking the exit button, which prompted a save file to override itself twice, fail to do so and get corrupted. The fix is unfortunately not retroactive! If you are currently experiencing the bug, follow the procedure on the pinned post in the forums to rescue the corrupted savefile. It should then not corrupt again;
 Fixed a visual bug with Sylas' sprite after visiting her boss ːsotablushː
 Fixed a misnamed variable in the confrontation with [spoiler]the Abyss[/spoiler] in the [spoiler]Dawn[/spoiler] path;
 Adjusted Lord Rizzo's epilogue line in the [spoiler]Dawn[/spoiler] path to be more natural;
 Fixed some scene transitions after the Festival—they should not accidentally spoil future illustrations/locations anymore;
 Added on Oct 31st: fixed Alpheon's Festival achievement, who should now trigger more reliably;
 Added on Nov 7th: fixed two softlocking conversations;

Quality of life changes

 The pages of the load menu and save menu are now synced!

