Hello hello hello! The last patch for the premiere build significantly improves the staging of most scenes in the game, restores some missing VA & squashes bugs that caused freezes!

Staging

 Improved the staging of virtually the whole game. Something happened after the first export that offset the protagonist to the right. I manually corrected all her positions;

VA

 Restored a missing voice line in the confrontation with the Abyss in the [spoiler]Avatar[/spoiler] path;
 Restored a missing voice line in the confrontation with Laverna in the [spoiler]Avatar[/spoiler] path;
 Amplified various lines;
 Restored VA to Malec’s introduction;
 Restored missing whisper lines in your first meeting with the siren;
 Fixed VA in Aleste’s temple scene;
 Restored a voiceline in the scene with the Prodigal One;

Text issues

 Fixed various typos
 Improved the flow of the conversation with Lord Rizzo;

Bugs

 The 'Divinity Confronted' scene can now be accessed correctly;
 The protagonist won’t lose an arm when healing Miché’s father;
 Removed a candle that snuffed itself out on the day of the Everlasting Prime;
 Fixed a bug that prevented you for accessing Marané's romance scene during the festival;
 Fixed a bug that made you enter a relationship with Malec... in Marané's romance;
 Fixed the Lady of Dreams messing up the staging during the Dance;
 The [spoiler]mortal[/spoiler] path now triggers correctly;



Hotfix 2
Minor fixes in assorted order:

 Fixed a wrong speaker when buying a gift for Sylas;
 Fixed the UI resetting to engine default if you accepted the duel in Malec's romance;
 Made some changes to the ‘Friend of Lapo’ codex entry;
 Removed Renza persisting through the [spoiler]Avatar[/spoiler] epilogue;
 Changed a line to accommodate Santanna being razed;
 Fixed the wrong skill button showing up when killing Laverna's lieutenants;
 Restored a missing voiceline in the confrontation with Atri;
 Improved the flow of the scene at The Rose in the [spoiler]Envoy[/spoiler] path;
 Restored a voiceline when you kill the Prodigal One;

